Five Below's net income was $358.6 million in fiscal year 2025 (the year ended January 31, 2026), up from $253.6 million in fiscal 2024. [1] The filing describes this as an increase of approximately $105.0 million, or 41.4% [1]. The fiscal year ran from February 2, 2025 to January 31, 2026, a 52-week period [2].